  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our E.C.W.C.S. Fleece Vest provides unparalleled warmth and comfort for any mission or outdoor adventure. Designed to work with the Extreme Cold Weather Clothing System, these tactical fleece vests are easy to layer under or over other clothing, allowing you to gear up for the task at hand. Whether you are a military professional, a tactical enthusiast, or an adventurer, this fleece vest is an essential piece of gear that combines functionality, durability, and comfort.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Our E.C.W.C.S. Fleece Vest provides unparalleled warmth and comfort for any mission or outdoor adventure. Designed to work with the Extreme Cold Weather Clothing System, these tactical fleece vests are easy to layer under or over other clothing, allowing you to gear up for the task at hand. Whether you are a military professional, a tactical enthusiast, or an adventurer, this fleece vest is an essential piece of gear that combines functionality, durability, and comfort. Thermal Insulation: Made of soft and warm polar fleece fabric that weighs 8.85 ounces, the midweight vest offers all-day comfort while keeping the heat in and the cold out, making it ideal for cooler climates or chilly nights in the field. This fleece vest is a must-have for your outdoor wardrobe. Protection from the Elements: The full-length front zipper features an interior storm placket that helps with insulating body heat and a chin guard that prevents you from getting accidentally nipped. In addition, the drawstring bottom allows for a customized fit. Breathable Side Panels: These comfortable vests feature grid fleece side panels for better breathability so that you don&rsquo;t overheat. The gridded panels help alleviate excess heat. Go ahead and take that wintery jog, chop away at those wood logs, or shovel until snow&rsquo;s out of the way. Utility at the Forefront: The outdoor vest comes equipped with a left chest zipper pocket for securing everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, or keys, while the front slash pockets keep your hands warm. The enhanced nylon shoulder and neck panels provide additional protection from pack straps when rucking or camping. Full Range of Motion: Acting as a sleeveless jacket, these warm vests give you room to freely use your arms as you chop wood, hike a difficult trail, or drive through the mountains.&nbsp;</p>",
